# Fallback:
#   youtube.com (live streams), pm.gc.ca/parl.ca (Canada), npr.org, pbs.org,
#   bbc.com, justice.gov, state.gov, senate.gov, house.gov, congress.gov,
#   presidency.ucsb.edu (American Presidency Project), americanrhetoric.com,
