SPEECH_ALLOWED_DOMAINS=c-span.org,whitehouse.gov,transcripts.cnn.com,factbase.com,millercenter.org,youtube.com,pm.gc.ca,parl.ca,npr.org,pbs.org,bbc.com,justice.gov,state.gov,senate.gov,house.gov,congress.gov,presidency.ucsb.edu,americanrhetoric.com,politico.com,reuters.com,apnews.com
SPEECH_ALLOWED_X_HANDLES=CSPAN,WhiteHouse,POTUS,atrupar,Acyn,CanadianPM,Reuters,AP,politico,PBSNewsHour,nprpolitics,BBCWorld,WSJ,axios,thehill,CBCNews,FactCheck,snopes,npr

