# Weather research profile.
# Kalshi resolves daily-temperature markets on the official NWS Climatological
# Report (CLI) issued in the early morning UTC for each city, with METAR
# observations as the authoritative intraday signal. The list below is ordered
# so the first SEARCH_PROFILE_MAX_DOMAINS entries are always the resolution-
# aligned primary sources, with remaining domains available as fallback /
# cross-reference when the search profile expands.
#
# Primary (resolution-aligned) - first 5 are most-used by Grok per search:
#   weather.gov              - NWS forecasts, observations, CLI/DSM products
#   api.weather.gov          - NWS structured JSON API (forecast, station obs, alerts)
#   forecast.weather.gov     - human-readable NWS forecast pages per CWA
#   mesonet.agron.iastate.edu- Iowa State Mesonet: queryable METAR archives
#                              (best source for "what was today's high so far?")
#   aviationweather.gov      - Aviation Weather Center: METAR/TAF live feed
#
# Fallback / cross-reference (used when search profile widens):
#   noaa.gov, ncei.noaa.gov  - NOAA umbrella + climate data archive
#   wpc.ncep.noaa.gov        - Weather Prediction Center 1-3 day fcst
#   spc.noaa.gov             - Storm Prediction Center (severe wx)
#   climate.gov              - NOAA climate normals (for sanity-check baselines)
#   tropicaltidbits.com      - model viz (GFS/ECMWF/NAM ensembles)
#   wunderground.com         - PWS network for sub-airport observations
#   accuweather.com          - alt forecast comparison
#   weather.com              - alt forecast comparison
#   timeanddate.com          - daily realized hi/low for cross-check
WEATHER_ALLOWED_DOMAINS=weather.gov,api.weather.gov,forecast.weather.gov,mesonet.agron.iastate.edu,aviationweather.gov,noaa.gov,ncei.noaa.gov,wpc.ncep.noaa.gov,spc.noaa.gov,climate.gov,tropicaltidbits.com,wunderground.com,accuweather.com,weather.com,timeanddate.com
# X handles ordered so the first SEARCH_PROFILE_MAX_X_HANDLES entries are
# the NWS national + the local offices that match the most-traded Kalshi
# weather cities (Las Vegas, Phoenix, Bay Area, Seattle, Boston, Detroit,
# plus the long-time list LA/NYC/Chicago/Houston/Miami). Capital Weather
# Gang and AccuWeather rotate in when the profile widens.
WEATHER_ALLOWED_X_HANDLES=NWS,NWSnhc,NWSSPC,NWSCPC,NWSLasVegas,NWSPhoenix,NWSBayArea,NWSSeattle,NWSBoston,NWSDetroit,NWSChicago,NWSNewYorkNY,NWSLosAngeles,NWSHouston,NWSMiami,NWSReno,NWSSanDiego,NWSAtlanta,NWSPhilly,NWSWashington,NWSDallas,NWSDenver,NWSPortland,NWSBuffalo,NHC_Atlantic,weatherchannel,AccuWeather,capitalweather,NOAASatellites,NOAAClimate
